# Fallback TOC: loaded by any client flavor that doesn't match one of the
# suffixed TOC files (_Vanilla/_TBC/_Wrath/_Cata/_Mists). Without this, "WoW:
# Forever" (WOW_PROJECT_MAINLINE, TOC interface 16000-19999) silently loads
# none of the addon's files. There is no recognized _Forever/_Mainline TOC
# suffix for it (confirmed: Auctionator, which supports both Forever and real
# retail, also ships a single unsuffixed TOC listing every interface version
# via a comma list rather than per-flavor files). See GameVersions.lua for the
# runtime IsForever/IsRetail-style split, which several established addons
# (e.g. Auctionator) use the same WOW_PROJECT_ID + build-number technique for.
